.TH KINTSUGI-PLAN 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi-plan \- read-only planning turn
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi plan
"<task>"
.br
.B kintsugi plan
list
.br
.B kintsugi plan
show <name>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a read-only planning turn. The agent analyzes the task and writes a plan
to .kintsugi/plans/ without making any code changes.
.SH OPTIONS
.IP \fB\-\-model\fR
Provider/model to use
.IP \fB\-\-persona\fR
Persona name override
.SH EXAMPLES
Create a plan:
.PP
  $ kintsugi plan "refactor the authentication module"
.PP
List saved plans:
.PP
  $ kintsugi plan list
.PP
View a specific plan:
.PP
  $ kintsugi plan show refactor-auth
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi (1),
.BR kintsugi-run (1)
